WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.688
Mi ɗon ɗaarugo to suudu ngam hisnugo ndu daga ɓooyɓe , wi'i ɓeynguɗo.

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:09.617
Koo ndeye jemma, o nyaami haa o waawi nyaamugo.

00:00:09.697 --> 00:00:12.960
Ɗuum ɗon ɓadito, ɓernde maako ɗon ɓilla.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.719
O wi'i hayre: "Ɗu'um woni ɓerɗe".

00:00:15.799 --> 00:00:18.394
Raatuuji mawɗi, mawɗi bana le'i!
